{
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FEFBF7\\,#FDF3E7)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#191A1B\\,#211F1D)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "{sym.y}+({sym.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#F0972A|#FFB454",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "sym",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "21.0pt",
        "y": "11pt",
        "w": "61pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${sym},--)]",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
      },
      {
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "14pt",
        "w": "134.0pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${at},--)]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "_note": "时效锚(card-design-system §3):右上角只放**取数时刻**,9pt / 右对齐 / SUB。\n⚠️ v? 前这里是 `${at} · 近 20 日` —— 把「这屏数字有多新」和「图画的是多长的窗口」拼成一句,两个量不同源、也不同用途。窗口说明已下沉到 `dNc`(蜡烛正上方),跟 kmid 卡把 `近 30 日` 放在图**下方**同一条判据:窗口说明贴着它描述的那张图。"
      },
      {
        "id": "num",
        "type": "richText",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "34pt",
        "w": "134.0pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "spans": [
          {
            "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${lead},--)]",
            "fontSize": "26pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          },
          {
            "text": "${leadT}",
            "fontSize": "16pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
